    "source_errata": [
      "The datasheet Figure 2 maps QFN pin 31 to gpio[0] and pin 38 to vssa1. The later text table also maps pin 31 to gpio[0] but incorrectly lists vssa1 as pins 31 and 52. This manifest follows Figure 2 and blocks freeze until ChipFoundry confirms the correction."
